Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Bifurcations in c", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0002835764381742`*^9, 4.000283576867496*^9}, {
  4.000286705114492*^9, 4.0002867084434834`*^9}, {4.0002895986431613`*^9, 
  4.000289604385121*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"77751112-7cbe-4681-b2a8-\
97c2704ced0c"],

Cell["\<\
From https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bifurcation_theory

Bifurcation theory is the mathematical study of changes in the qualitative or \
topological structure of a given family of curves, such as the integral \
curves of a family of vector fields, and the solutions of a family of \
differential equations. Most commonly applied to the mathematical study of \
dynamical systems, a bifurcation occurs when a small smooth change made to \
the parameter values (the bifurcation parameters) of a system causes a sudden \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]qualitative\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] or topological \
change in its behavior.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0002896642790127`*^9, 
  4.0002897021489944`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ea52a2a2-9766-49bb-98fd-\
5b126c0664a9"],

Cell["\<\
The Rossler bifurcates as c changes. The picture below shows the system going \
from attractive single loop solutions to attractive double loop solutions, to \
attractive four loop solutions. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0002897137246456`*^9, 4.0002897430116997`*^9}, {
  4.0002898505559893`*^9, 
  4.0002899242177477`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f023997d-523d-45d3-a95d-\
792c05e2dded"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "}"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0.2", ",", "0.2"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"u0", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"2.3", ",", "3.4"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"BifurcationData", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"PtData", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"CollectSectionPoints", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"a", ",", "b", ",", "c"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", "f", "}"}]}], "]"}], "[", "u0", "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
          RowBox[{"c", ",", "40"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"PtData", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "40"}], ";;", 
            RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], ",", "3"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], 
        "}"}], "\[Transpose]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"c", ",", " ", "2", ",", "4.2", ",", "0.1"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"Pic", "=", 
  RowBox[{"ListPlot", "[", 
   RowBox[{"BifurcationData", ",", 
    RowBox[{"GridLines", "\[Rule]", "Automatic"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"AxesLabel", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "\"\<c\>\"", ",", "\"\<\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(y\), \(3\)]\)\>\""}], 
      "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0002867401586466`*^9, 4.000286781923273*^9}, {
